  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Any time I join a world, player voices sound extremely loud like they're literally 2 inches from me, and they sound like they're coming out of the wrong side. If they're on my left, their voice will be coming from somewhere entirely different. This wasn't happening before this most resent build, idk what happened, but it makes existing a pain. And apparently I'm not the only one this is happening to, several people I know are having this problem.",
